Daily cost history preserves exact decimal basis without market prices.

========== API ==========

totalHistory({ valuation: 'cost', accounts: ['Assets:'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {0.100000000000000001 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  0.2 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "0.500000000000000003",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]
